## 🚀 Getting started

Fresh clone? The setup script creates `.env` (generating any secrets), installs dependencies{{#if database}}, and starts the database{{/if}}:

```bash
bash scripts/setup.sh          # interactive
bash scripts/setup.sh --yes    # non-interactive
```

Then start the dev server:

```bash
{{packageManager}} run dev
```

## 📜 Scripts

| Command | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `{{packageManager}} run dev` | Start the dev server |
| `{{packageManager}} run build` | Build for production |
| `{{packageManager}} run start` | Start the production server |
| `{{packageManager}} run check` | Type-check, lint, and format-check |
| `{{packageManager}} run lint` | Run ESLint |
| `{{packageManager}} run typecheck` | Type-check |
| `{{packageManager}} run format` | Format with Prettier |

## ✅ Conventions

- **Commits** — [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) (`type(scope): description`), enforced by a `commit-msg` hook.
- **Imports** — `@/` maps to `./src/`, e.g. `import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button"`.
